{"seq":2,"slug":"guarantee-instrument-liability-allocation","title":"担保工具（保函/保险/担保人）与责任分摊机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customs-transit-tir-ncts-bonded-through-transport/customs-transit-regime-guarantee-model/guarantee-instrument-liability-allocation","wordCount":2710,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"担保工具-保函-保险-担保人-与责任分摊机制\">担保工具（保函/保险/担保人）与责任分摊机制</h1><p>一票从成都经阿拉山口出境、过哈萨克斯坦、俄罗斯再到波兰的陆运货，报关行提交过境申报时，真正决定能不能放行的往往不是货物信息，而是一条<strong>担保记录号</strong>——额度够不够、担保人受不受目的地海关承认。过境制度的核心经济安排就在这里：海关把&quot;货物在境内期间可能出现的税款流失风险&quot;提前锁定成一份<strong>可执行的担保</strong>。本文拆解担保的工具形态、额度计算，以及出事时赔偿责任沿担保链回溯分摊的机制。担保制度的适用范围与准入见同章 <a href=\"./\">海关过境制度与担保链法律模型</a>；申报端如何把担保号组织成报文并逐跳校验，见 <a href=\"../tir-ncts-declaration-transit-procedure/tir-ncts-message-model-data-spec\">TIR-EPD 与 NCTS 申报数据模型及消息规范（MRN/IE 报文）</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-担保链把-政府垫付风险-变成了可交易信用\">核心概念：担保链把&quot;政府垫付风险&quot;变成了可交易信用</h2><p>过境转运（transit）的本质是<strong>税款递延</strong>：货物在起运地海关放行、中途经第三国过境、到目的地海关结关，期间进口国本可征收的关税与增值税被暂时不征。海关愿意放行的前提，是有主体承诺&quot;如果货物没到、被私吞、或被违规销售，这笔税款我付&quot;。承诺的主体就是<strong>担保人（guarantor）</strong>，而它敢承诺，是因为背后有一条从<strong>过境持有人（holder / principal）→ 担保人 → 再保险或联保池</strong>的分摊链。</p>\n<p>理解担保工具，要先区分两个常被混淆的角色：<strong>纳税人/债务人（debtor）</strong>——法律上最终欠税的主体，通常是过境持有人或进口商本人；<strong>担保人（guarantor）</strong>——向海关承诺代债务人付款的第三方，付款后取得<strong>对债务人的追偿权（right of recovery）</strong>。</p>\n<p>由此形成担保工具的&quot;信用转换&quot;性质：海关面对的不再是一个可能跑路的运输公司，而是一家受监管的金融机构或联保协会。担保的两个边界为——</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mtext>required</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>guarantor</mtext></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mtext>required</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>statutory</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_{\\text{required}} = R \\times (1 - r), \\qquad L_{\\text{guarantor}} \\le \\min(G_{\\text{required}},\\, C_{\\text{statutory}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">required</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">guarantor</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">required</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">statutory</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>参考金额（reference amount）</strong>，即海关按货物税负估算的风险敞口；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 是减免系数（0 表示全额担保，1 表示全额豁免）；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>statutory</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{statutory}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">statutory</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是法定封顶额（如 TIR 单证每份的封顶）。两者取小，即担保责任的实际上限。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  P[&quot;过境持有人&lt;br/&gt;Principal / Holder&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;缴纳保费/保证金&lt;br/&gt;承担最终税款&quot;| G[&quot;担保人&lt;br/&gt;Guarantor&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt;|&quot;出具保函/保证&lt;br/&gt;登记担保额度&quot;| C[&quot;海关&lt;br/&gt;Customs Authority&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt;|&quot;凭担保放行&lt;br/&gt;税款递延&quot;| P&#10;  C -.-&gt;|&quot;未结关 触发索赔&quot;| G&#10;  G -.-&gt;|&quot;代偿后&lt;br/&gt;行使追偿权&quot;| P&#10;  G --&gt;|&quot;二次分摊&lt;br/&gt;联保池/再保险&quot;| R[&quot;联保协会 /&lt;br/&gt;国际保险池 /&lt;br/&gt;再保险人&quot;]&#10;  R -.-&gt;|&quot;按份额回补&quot;| G\">flowchart TD\n  P[\"过境持有人&lt;br/&gt;Principal / Holder\"] --&gt;|\"缴纳保费/保证金&lt;br/&gt;承担最终税款\"| G[\"担保人&lt;br/&gt;Guarantor\"]\n  G --&gt;|\"出具保函/保证&lt;br/&gt;登记担保额度\"| C[\"海关&lt;br/&gt;Customs Authority\"]\n  C --&gt;|\"凭担保放行&lt;br/&gt;税款递延\"| P\n  C -.-&gt;|\"未结关 触发索赔\"| G\n  G -.-&gt;|\"代偿后&lt;br/&gt;行使追偿权\"| P\n  G --&gt;|\"二次分摊&lt;br/&gt;联保池/再保险\"| R[\"联保协会 /&lt;br/&gt;国际保险池 /&lt;br/&gt;再保险人\"]\n  R -.-&gt;|\"按份额回补\"| G</pre><p>海关只对上一个人主张权利（担保人），担保人再往下追。TIR 能跨境通行靠的不是单家运输公司的信用，而是各国**保证协会（guaranteeing association）**组成的联保结构——各协会均为 IRU 成员，由 IRU 管理的国际保险池做二次分摊 <a href=\"https://unece.org/transport/tir-convention\">UNECE, <em>TIR Convention</em></a>；<a href=\"https://www.iru.org/\">IRU</a>。这就是&quot;信用转换&quot;：把 N 个承运人的信用风险收敛成 1 个受条约约束的联保主体。</p>\n<h2 id=\"担保工具谱系-保函-保证金-保证保险与担保人担保\">担保工具谱系：保函、保证金、保证保险与担保人担保</h2><p>实务中落地的担保工具是四类，各自对应不同的资金占用与合规成本。区分的关键维度有三个：<strong>是否占用现金</strong>、<strong>海关是否直接可执行</strong>、<strong>能否复用（额度型 vs 单票型）</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具形态</th>\n<th>现金占用</th>\n<th>海关可直接兑现</th>\n<th>额度特性</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>银行保函（bank guarantee）</strong></td>\n<td>低（保证金/授信占用）</td>\n<td>是（见索即付）</td>\n<td>额度型、可循环</td>\n<td>EU 综合担保、大额过境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>现金保证金（cash deposit）</strong></td>\n<td>高（全额冻结）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>单票或额度型</td>\n<td>新主体、争议期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>保证保险（guarantee insurance）</strong></td>\n<td>中（保费）</td>\n<td>需保险条款支持</td>\n<td>额度型</td>\n<td>商业保险公司承保过境责任</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>担保人 / 保证协会担保</strong></td>\n<td>低（会员费+反担保）</td>\n<td>是（依条约）</td>\n<td>单票（TIR）或额度型</td>\n<td>TIR 单证、ATA 单证册</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>欧盟《联盟海关法典》（UCC, Regulation (EU) No 952/2013）第 92 条允许当事人在四类担保形式中<strong>自选</strong>：现金存款、担保人承诺，以及其他能提供同等保证的形式 <a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2013/952/oj\">EUR-Lex, <em>Regulation (EU) No 952/2013</em></a>。这套&quot;形式可选、效力等同&quot;的设计是担保工具多样化的法律基础：海关关心的是<strong>可兑现性</strong>，而非当事人用哪种金融工具。</p>\n<p>TIR 体系用的是第四类。中国于 2016 年 7 月正式实施《TIR 公约》，由中国国际商会担任中国境内的保证协会 <a href=\"https://unece.org/transport/tir-convention\">UNECE TIR 公约成员信息</a>。工程要点是：<strong>TIR 的担保是单票型（per-carnet）而非额度型</strong>——每份单证自带法定封顶的担保额，持证人无需先抵押大额综合担保。</p>\n<p>与之相对，欧盟境内过境走<strong>额度型</strong>路线：担保人先向海关登记一笔**综合担保（comprehensive guarantee）<strong>及其参考金额，之后每票过境申报（IE001/T-consignment）从该额度&quot;占用（reserve）&quot;，结关后再&quot;释放（release）&quot;。这本账本由 NCTS 的</strong>担保管理模块（GUM）**维护 <a href=\"https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/customs-4/customs-procedures-0/transit/ncts_en\">European Commission, <em>NCTS</em></a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"责任分摊机制-谁在什么时点被追偿\">责任分摊机制：谁在什么时点被追偿</h2><p>担保工具的价值只有在<strong>索赔发生时</strong>才被真正检验。责任分摊要回答三个问题：<strong>触发条件</strong>、<strong>追偿顺序</strong>、<strong>时效</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>触发条件</strong>是&quot;过境程序未被适当结关（not discharged）&quot;：货物未在期限内到达目的地海关、封志（seal）破损且无法解释、中途被违规处置；目的地海关在时限内未出具结关证明，起运地海关即启动索赔。</p>\n<p><strong>追偿顺序</strong>沿担保链自下而上：海关先向<strong>担保人</strong>主张全额（担保人通常与债务人承担连带责任）→ 担保人代偿后依<strong>追偿权</strong>向<strong>过境持有人</strong>追索 → 持证人无力偿付时损失沿<strong>联保池/再保险</strong>结构分摊。TIR 把第一步写进条约：《TIR 公约》第 8 条规定保证协会对进口国海关<strong>直接承担</strong>关税与税款责任，并赋予其付款后的追偿权 <a href=\"https://unece.org/transport/tir-convention\">UNECE, <em>TIR Convention, Art. 8</em></a>；联保池把单票损失扩散到全体系，使 TIR 能承受&quot;单个承运人破产&quot;而不让某一国海关独自承担坏账。</p>\n<p><strong>时效</strong>是最容易在系统里被写错的部分。《TIR 公约》第 11 条规定，保证协会的责任自 TIR 单证被接受之日起<strong>满 3 年届满</strong>，这意味着担保额度不能无限期占用——系统必须按单证接受日计算到期并自动释放 <a href=\"https://unece.org/transport/tir-convention\">UNECE, <em>TIR Convention, Art. 11</em></a>。欧盟侧的对应制度是海关债务的<strong>通信时效</strong>：未在法定期限内向债务人/担保人送达税款通知，担保即告解除，UCC 及其条例对债务通信设有 3 年基准期并对担保人规定独立通知要求 <a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2013/952/oj\">EUR-Lex, <em>Regulation (EU) No 952/2013</em></a>。四条分摊层级如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分摊层级</th>\n<th>主体</th>\n<th>触发时点</th>\n<th>责任性质</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第一层</td>\n<td>过境持有人</td>\n<td>程序未结关</td>\n<td>最终税款的债务人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第二层</td>\n<td>担保人 / 保证协会</td>\n<td>海关索赔通知</td>\n<td>对海关直接责任，代偿后追偿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三层</td>\n<td>保险公司</td>\n<td>保函/保险条款生效</td>\n<td>按保单责任限额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第四层</td>\n<td>联保池 / 再保险人</td>\n<td>担保人代偿后</td>\n<td>按份额回补担保人</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"担保额度计算-参考金额-减免系数与风险分层\">担保额度计算：参考金额、减免系数与风险分层</h2><p>额度不是拍脑袋定的，而是从<strong>潜在税负</strong>倒推。核心变量是<strong>参考金额（reference amount）</strong>：海关按适用税率、货值、数量估算出的、该笔过境业务可能产生的关税与税款总额。额度推导为——</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mtext>Duty</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>VAT</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>G</mi><mtext>required</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mtext>risk</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = \\sum_{i} \\left( \\text{Duty}_i + \\text{VAT}_i \\right), \\qquad G_{\\text{required}} = R \\times k_{\\text{risk}} \\times (1 - r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Duty</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">VAT</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">required</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">risk</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mtext>risk</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_{\\text{risk}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">risk</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是海关根据商品类别、路线风险施加的调整系数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 是减免系数。</p>\n<p>欧盟对<strong>综合担保</strong>设有一套<strong>分级减免</strong>机制：财务状况良好、长期合规使用过境制度的当事人可申请降低担保金额，条件全部满足时可减免至<strong>零（全额豁免）</strong>，依据是 UCC 第 94–95 条及其实施条例 <a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2015/2447/oj\">EUR-Lex, <em>Commission Implementing Regulation (EU) 2015/2447</em></a>。对系统的含义很直接：<strong>同一笔货，不同持证人需要的担保额度可能相差一个数量级</strong>——担保计算不能写死比例，必须按持证人的减免档案动态求值。反之，对新主体或有欠税记录的主体，海关可要求全额现金担保甚至拒绝综合担保，由此形成从&quot;减免登记&quot;到&quot;全额现金&quot;的风险分层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"系统实现-担保账户的数据模型与状态机\">系统实现：担保账户的数据模型与状态机</h2><p>把上述制度翻译成系统，担保管理模块的核心是<strong>一个额度账户 + 一组占用记录 + 一条状态机</strong>。数据模型至少表达四类实体：**Guarantee（担保）**记录担保人、类型、参考金额、可用额度与有效期；**Guarantee Usage（占用）**记录由哪票申报触发、占用金额与时点；**Liability（责任）**记录债务主体、申报号、金额与时效截止日；**Recovery（追偿）**记录担保人的追偿与分摊结果。</p>\n<p>担保额度的生命周期是一条状态机，任一状态处理错误都会导致&quot;额度泄漏&quot;（占用未释放）或&quot;超放行&quot;（额度不足仍放行）：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; Registered: 担保人登记参考金额&#10;  Registered --&gt; Active: 海关受理并激活&#10;  Active --&gt; Reserved: 过境申报占用额度&#10;  Reserved --&gt; Released: 目的地结关 释放占用&#10;  Reserved --&gt; Claimed: 超期未结关 触发索赔&#10;  Released --&gt; Active: 额度回到可用池&#10;  Claimed --&gt; Recovered: 担保人代偿并追偿&#10;  Claimed --&gt; WrittenOff: 超过时效 核销&#10;  Recovered --&gt; Active&#10;  WrittenOff --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; Registered: 担保人登记参考金额\n  Registered --&gt; Active: 海关受理并激活\n  Active --&gt; Reserved: 过境申报占用额度\n  Reserved --&gt; Released: 目的地结关 释放占用\n  Reserved --&gt; Claimed: 超期未结关 触发索赔\n  Released --&gt; Active: 额度回到可用池\n  Claimed --&gt; Recovered: 担保人代偿并追偿\n  Claimed --&gt; WrittenOff: 超过时效 核销\n  Recovered --&gt; Active\n  WrittenOff --&gt; [*]</pre><p>TIR 与 NCTS 的差异也体现在这里：TIR 是<strong>单票制</strong>，系统只需校验单证封顶额与路线是否被承认，不维护长期额度池；NCTS 的 GUM 是<strong>额度池制</strong>，必须实时维护占用—释放账本，并在起运国海关、目的地国海关、担保人之间同步 <a href=\"https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/customs-4/customs-procedures-0/transit/ncts_en\">European Commission, <em>NCTS</em></a>。英国脱欧后作为《共同过境公约》独立缔约方运行自己的 NCTS 实例，担保同样由 HMRC 批准的担保人出具并按占用—释放模型管理 <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/common-transit-convention\">UK Government, <em>Common Transit Convention</em></a>——不同法域<strong>法律外壳不同，数据模型高度收敛</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>过境担保的本质是<strong>税款递延的信用转换</strong>：海关把风险转移给担保人，担保人再沿担保链向下追偿。</li>\n<li>担保工具分四类——银行保函、现金保证金、保证保险、担保人/协会担保；UCC 第 92 条允许<strong>形式可选、效力等同</strong>。</li>\n<li>TIR 是<strong>单票型</strong>担保（每份单证自带法定封顶），NCTS 是<strong>额度型</strong>担保（综合担保额度池 + 占用/释放）。</li>\n<li>责任分摊沿&quot;持有人 → 担保人 → 保险 → 联保池&quot;四层回溯，TIR 第 8 条确立保证协会对海关的<strong>直接责任</strong>。</li>\n<li>额度由<strong>参考金额 × 风险系数 × (1 − 减免系数)</strong> 推导，欧盟对综合担保设有可至<strong>全额豁免</strong>的分级减免。</li>\n<li><strong>时效</strong>最易出错：TIR 责任自单证接受起 3 年届满，到期必须自动释放额度，否则额度泄漏。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"担保工具（保函/保险/担保人）与责任分摊机制","id":"担保工具-保函-保险-担保人-与责任分摊机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：担保链把\"政府垫付风险\"变成了可交易信用","id":"核心概念-担保链把-政府垫付风险-变成了可交易信用"},{"level":2,"text":"担保工具谱系：保函、保证金、保证保险与担保人担保","id":"担保工具谱系-保函-保证金-保证保险与担保人担保"},{"level":2,"text":"责任分摊机制：谁在什么时点被追偿","id":"责任分摊机制-谁在什么时点被追偿"},{"level":2,"text":"担保额度计算：参考金额、减免系数与风险分层","id":"担保额度计算-参考金额-减免系数与风险分层"},{"level":2,"text":"系统实现：担保账户的数据模型与状态机","id":"系统实现-担保账户的数据模型与状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"过境制度的分类与担保链角色模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customs-transit-tir-ncts-bonded-through-transport/customs-transit-regime-guarantee-model/transit-regime-taxonomy-guarantee-chain"},"next":{"title":"过境准入授权、制度差异与违规处罚矩阵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customs-transit-tir-ncts-bonded-through-transport/customs-transit-regime-guarantee-model/transit-authorization-compliance-matrix"}}